    description: "WHAT. Four rows of the fifteen in WI-lunal cannot be fixed by the matcher key, because the analyzer records nothing a row could read. Each is marked CANNOT FIRE in its YAML and pinned by a test as not matching (test_wrong_field_rows.py).\n- PHP: @test docblock tags and #[Test] attributes (php.py records neither). koel alone has 742 #[Test] tests, none detected.\n- F#: [<Fact>], [<Test>], [<Theory>] on a function or member, and [<EntryPoint>] (fsharp.py records no attribute, so an F# program's main is not an entry either).\n- D: @(\"test\") user-defined attributes; a unittest block is not a symbol.\n- Plug: the row keyed on a decorator named conn. A module plug is a module defining init/1 and call/2, a function plug a function of (conn, opts); neither is detected.\n\nASK. Per analyzer: record attributes in meta.annotations (PHP attributes and docblock tags, F#, D), then re-key the rows; design a Plug detector or delete the row.\n\nFound during PR #2329 (2026-11-22). Evidence: ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/three_pr_plan_11222026/pr2/RESULTS.md and RESIDUALS_TO_FILE.md."  # ecc7
